1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,440
A grid of boxes...

2
00:00:02,020 --> 00:00:05,240
and every single line must add up the same!

3
00:00:06,460 --> 00:00:08,280
This is Magic Square!

4
00:00:10,110 --> 00:00:13,580
Every row and column has to equal fifteen!

5
00:00:15,180 --> 00:00:15,860
Two...

6
00:00:15,860 --> 00:00:17,620
plus seven...

7
00:00:17,620 --> 00:00:19,220
plus six...

8
00:00:19,720 --> 00:00:20,680
that's fifteen!

9
00:00:22,140 --> 00:00:23,040
Four...

10
00:00:23,040 --> 00:00:24,280
plus three...

11
00:00:24,280 --> 00:00:25,680
plus eight...

12
00:00:26,400 --> 00:00:29,120
fifteen again — the square is complete!

13
00:00:30,280 --> 00:00:33,960
Every row, every column — all fifteen.

14
00:00:34,740 --> 00:00:35,760
That's the magic!

15
00:00:37,140 --> 00:00:42,540
Parents — this builds structured thinking, the foundation for algebra later!

16
00:00:43,700 --> 00:00:49,820
Tap Math Game Zone, unlock Magic Square, pick your level, and complete the square!

17
00:00:49,820 --> 00:00:54,860
